      "created_at": "2024-11-19T03:33:04.582Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a child table where I don’t want the user adding or removing rows, and I don’t need the multi-select checkboxes that comes on the lefthand side. Does anyone know how to remove these?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/6/96c1000647ccb668691210417a77d45babe3c5f3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/96c1000647ccb668691210417a77d45babe3c5f3\" title=\"Screenshot (58)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/6/96c1000647ccb668691210417a77d45babe3c5f3_2_690x210.png\" alt=\"Screenshot (58)\" data-base62-sha1=\"lvD7wwPnvbk1dEtxqduaalXQszp\" width=\"690\" height=\"210\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/6/96c1000647ccb668691210417a77d45babe3c5f3_2_690x210.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/6/96c1000647ccb668691210417a77d45babe3c5f3_2_1035x315.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/6/96c1000647ccb668691210417a77d45babe3c5f3_2_1380x420.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot (58)</span><span class=\"informations\">1572×479 51.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
