    {
      "id": 446461,
      "username": "NCP",
      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2024-11-19T04:26:30.107Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"rogerbaron\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"137559\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dfb087/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> rogerbaron:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don’t want the user adding or removing rows</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Better is, no need to remove the checkbox but you can remove the delete and Add Item option from the table, so please check the syntax.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.ui.form.on('Your DocType', {\n    refresh: function(frm) {\n       frm.set_df_property('items', 'cannot_add_rows', true);\n       frm.set_df_property('items', 'cannot_delete_rows', true);\n       frm.set_df_property('items', 'cannot_delete_all_rows', true);\n    }\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p>Please check the doctype name and table fieldname in the script.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/{size}/66573_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
