    {
      "id": 478650,
      "username": "AbhishekJupalli-1409",
      "name": "Abhishek Jupalli 1409",
      "created_at": "2025-08-22T11:00:09.953Z",
      "cooked": "<pre><code>frm.fields_dict['table_name'].grid.wrapper.find('.grid-add-row, .grid-remove-rows').hide();\nfrm.fields_dict['table_name'].grid.wrapper.find('.grid-delete-row').hide();\n</code></pre>\n<p>we can also hide them using this this wrapper</p>",
